						<memberName>Serketist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>First Scarab Lord</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Scarab Lord</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Led by the sacred Hive Queens, Insectoids are the perfect lifeform in the galaxy. They are the pinnacle of evolution. Ravenous. Destructive. Resistant. Everyone should strive to become like them. Perhaps, with time, we will learn from them, becoming like a tidal wave that will wash over our enemies.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Led by the sacred Hive Queens, Insectoids are the perfect lifeform in the galaxy. They are the pinnacle of evolution. Ravenous. Destructive. Resistant. Everyone should strive to become like them. Perhaps, with time, we will learn from them, becoming like a tidal wave that will wash over our enemies.</descriptionTemplate>
