						<memberName>Subject</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Prime Beast</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Prime Beast</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Osamu Hebert built an army that spread his power and glory across the land, placing those who refused to follow rightly under his rule. Hebert went to commune with the animals in the fields and forests, and connected with them as equals. We learned that the eternal growth of humanity is a path to hell; we must live in nature instead of consuming it.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Osamu Hebert built an army that spread his power and glory across the land, placing those who refused to follow rightly under his rule. Hebert went to commune with the animals in the fields and forests, and connected with them as equals. We learned that the eternal growth of humanity is a path to hell; we must live in nature instead of consuming it.</descriptionTemplate>
