						<name>Ani-Gestalt</name>
						<adjective>gestalt</adjective>
						<memberName>Extension</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Spirit Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Spirit Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>A parallel universe of spirits lies next to our own. A seemingly inanimate object in this universe corresponds to an animated spirit in the other. Humanity itself is represented by a single, overencompasing spirit, and only by liberating ourselves of our individuality will we be able to embrace it. Our sages say that the spirit of the great &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Hexfocus&lt;/color&gt; will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>A parallel universe of spirits lies next to our own. A seemingly inanimate object in this universe corresponds to an animated spirit in the other. Humanity itself is represented by a single, overencompasing spirit, and only by liberating ourselves of our individuality will we be able to embrace it. Our sages say that the spirit of the great %%relic0_name%% will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</descriptionTemplate>
