						<name>Neo-Pasturism</name>
						<adjective>pasturic</adjective>
						<memberName>Pasturist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>High Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>High Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"The first ten among my followers tore the devices from their skin with bare hands, and in the blood spatters on the grimy floor I suddenly perceived the truth we had all been missing: Living in a polluted body is no human life at all. It's something you come to accept, partner, on the lonely trails of the range, listenin' to the animals sleepin' while you sit around the fire."

  - Cribangada 'Monkey' Ñoño, Know-Yourself Address on the bramble</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"The first ten among my followers tore the devices from their skin with bare hands, and in the blood spatters on the grimy floor I suddenly perceived the truth we had all been missing: Living in a polluted body is no human life at all. It's something you come to accept, partner, on the lonely trails of the range, listenin' to the animals sleepin' while you sit around the fire."

  - Cribangada 'Monkey' Ñoño, Know-Yourself Address on the bramble</descriptionTemplate>
