						<name>High Legion</name>
						<adjective>agnostic</adjective>
						<memberName>Agnostic</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>First Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Red Ratocom built an army that spread her power and glory across the land, placing those who refused to follow rightly under her rule. Red instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, she used a chem-warfare bomb to kill everyone inside. Red's speech at a &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Unbelieving Inhumation&lt;/color&gt; inspired many to lead a prime life, free of the shackles of magical thinking. Thus she will always be remembered amongst our people as: The Light in the Dark.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Red Ratocom built an army that spread her power and glory across the land, placing those who refused to follow rightly under her rule. Red instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, she used a chem-warfare bomb to kill everyone inside. Red's speech at a %%ritual0_name%% inspired many to lead a prime life, free of the shackles of magical thinking. Thus she will always be remembered amongst our people as: The Light in the Dark.</descriptionTemplate>
