						<name>Iron-Fisted Path</name>
						<adjective>unitary</adjective>
						<memberName>Unitist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>High Stellarch</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>High Stellarch</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"The maid stopped contributing but kept eating from the common store. I killed him with a warhammer. The people were shocked, but I explained that In these days our generations are not merely faced with territorial and political problems, but also with supreme issues of the existence of our faith, our civilization and our culture, which are now at stake once more. My wife even tried to argue with me about this - can you believe it? It wasn't hard to shut her up."

  - Petronas Phokas, on a passionate Disquisition on the cave</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"The maid stopped contributing but kept eating from the common store. I killed him with a warhammer. The people were shocked, but I explained that In these days our generations are not merely faced with territorial and political problems, but also with supreme issues of the existence of our faith, our civilization and our culture, which are now at stake once more. My wife even tried to argue with me about this - can you believe it? It wasn't hard to shut her up."

  - Petronas Phokas, on a passionate Disquisition on the cave</descriptionTemplate>
