						<name>Moral Justice</name>
						<adjective>just</adjective>
						<memberName>Justicar</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Moral Conqueror</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Moral Conqueror</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In a broken world, Red House saw all that was wrong and created our movement. House instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, he used an archotech mass-inverter to kill everyone inside. The Justicars would not have understood the true nature of violence without House's teachings.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In a broken world, Red House saw all that was wrong and created our movement. House instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, he used an archotech mass-inverter to kill everyone inside. The %%memberNamePlural%% would not have understood the true nature of violence without House's teachings.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
